  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -IR verb with e→i stem change",
    "Stem change applies in presente (all forms except nosotros/nosotras): *visto, vistes, viste, visten*",
    "In pretérito indefinido, e→i appears in 3rd person only: *se vistió, se vistieron*",
    "All other tenses are regular (-IR endings, no stem change)",
    "Past participle: vestido (regular)",
    "*Me visto rápido por las mañanas* = I get dressed quickly in the mornings",
    "Non-reflexive form: *vestir* = to dress (someone else); *La madre viste al niño* = The mother dresses the child",
    "Related: la ropa (clothing), el vestido (dress), desvestirse (to get undressed)"
  ],
